      "content": "wait, you're saying the stock counts are \"robust\" but we should show a low number? if the warehouse is actually full won't that be fine? i mean if we tell them it's low just to get sales, isn't that kind of lying to the customers? i dont want us to get flagged for false advertising if they realize we have plenty in stock.",
